    "created_at": "2021-03-02T23:11:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-03-02T23:11:53Z",
    "body": "From what I can understand your use case (ignoring the proposed solution, per https://whatwg.org/faq#adding-new-features) is allowing links to files that open in a specific list of OS-provided applications.\r\n\r\nThis is already possible today, if you set the correct content-type on the server: see step 11 in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#process-a-navigate-response . As such, this use case is already covered by HTML, so I'll close this issue.",
