    "updated_at": "2024-01-03T09:41:51Z",
    "body": "What browsers currently do is download the file to your hard drive and from there open it with an application. If you modify the content and save it the content is written to the hard drive.\r\n\r\nWhat I'm talking about is directly opening the file in the application using WebDAV and then save it directly to the server with a PUT request.\r\n\r\nAnd it is also important that you can choose the application to use with a menu just like in a file explorer.\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
