    "updated_at": "2024-01-03T09:41:52Z",
    "body": "And HTML is not only about render web pages. It is also about linking content with \"a\" and \"link\".  And I have found that the \"a\" element has a \"type\" attribute I think that is what I want with a different name :).  Fantastic, you can keep the issue closed. \r\n\r\nhttps://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/a\r\n\r\nhttps://developer.mozilla.org/es/docs/Web/HTML/Element/link",
